Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,One {\c&H1EB0F2&}experiment.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.37,0:00:03.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,No guarantees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:06.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Business one: I'm reaching\Nout to real companies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:08.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,and trying to win paying\Ncustomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:11.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Business two: the\Nsoftware I'm building to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,run that outreach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:15.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,If it genuinely helps\Nme, it might become a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,product for other\Npeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:17.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:19.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,The software has one\Nuser: me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:20.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:24.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:25.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's the {\c&H1EB0F2&}experiment.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:28.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the first business\Nworks, the tool earns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:29.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:32.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the tool works, it\Nmight become a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:32.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Follow along and watch\Nwhether either one does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:36.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm Andrew.
